Package: gh0st-camera
Version: @GH0ST_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Gh0st OS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Depends: gh0st, libcamera0.7 (= @V:libcamera0.7@), libcamera-ipa (= @V:libcamera-ipa@), libjpeg62-turbo, libstdc++6,
 libavformat61, libavcodec61, libavutil59, libswscale8, libswresample5, libpulse0
Description: the Gh0st OS camera
 Photos and video with sound from the CardputerZero's camera, and a gallery
 that plays them. gh0st-camd, its helper, drives libcamera; it is built
 against this exact libcamera. ffmpeg's libraries encode the sound and play
 videos back, and libpulse reaches PipeWire.
